title: "Supply Chain Design Notes"
abstract: "A practitioner-oriented learning resource covering demand and forecasting, network design and digital connectivity, sourcing and supplier execution, internal operations, inventory, logistics and trade, customer relationship management, supplier relationship management, strategic alliances, supplier performance and certification, communication, and continuous improvement through original explanations, diagrams, datasets, knowledge checks, and integrated case studies."
